RepoMind 2.0
Repository-Aware AI Engineering Review & PR Risk Assistant
Core problem

Small engineering teams often have a problem that is more subtle than “we need code review.”

They need to answer:

“Can this change be safely merged into our codebase?”

That requires answering several different questions:

Is the code correct?
        ↓
Does it introduce security problems?
        ↓
Does it follow our repository's rules?
        ↓
Will it break existing behavior?
        ↓
Will it conflict with other recent changes?
        ↓
Are tests missing?
        ↓
Is the PR likely to need significant rework?
        ↓
What exactly should the human reviewer look at?

A normal LLM only sees part of this.

RepoMind combines the evidence.

