And there is a clean boundary between AI assistance and employee surveillance. You can analyze PRs, recurring issue categories, review iterations, and assistance needs without assigning developers a performance score, which agrees with your existing fairness requirement.

The automatic-trigger portion is also realistic rather than hypothetical: GitHub webhooks are intended for event-driven integrations such as CI and other automated actions, and GitHub exposes PR/review APIs that support the review lifecycle.

